<title>SLOVAKIA: SLOVAK JULY CPI RISES 0.1 PCT,  UP 6.0 PCT Y/Y.</title>
<headline>SLOVAK JULY CPI RISES 0.1 PCT,  UP 6.0 PCT Y/Y.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak July consumer prices (CPI) rose 0.1 percent, putting year-on-year inflation at 6.0 percent, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>June CPI was up 0.3 percent and annual inflation at 6.2 percent.</p>
</text>
